The libraries the SDK takes from the packages of PIE's ports come from those
ports' source packages instead. The heading of each one's section in the
copyright file names the source package and its version: the source package
SOURCE at version VERSION is in the release tagged blueberry-pie-os/VERSION
at https://github.com/blueberrypieos/SOURCE. Where the repository has another
name, the heading gives its address after the version.
